{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50340","headline":"题故人所居 · 佚名","name":"题故人所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与君昔离别，星岁爲三周；今日觏颜色，苍然双鬓秋。\n茅居枕河浒，耕凿傍山丘。\n往往登憇迳，时时或饭牛。\n一身尚栖屑，庶身安无忧？\n相见未言语，唏吁先泪流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}